{"seq":7,"slug":"prompt-engineering","title":"Prompt Engineering & Design","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.14,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":4.05,"verdict":"recommend","uScore":5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"prompt-engineering-design-简介\">Prompt Engineering &amp; Design 简介</h1><p>大语言模型的能力边界在很大程度上由你怎么&quot;问&quot;来决定。同一个模型，面对一个含糊的指令可能给出平庸甚至错误的回答，而面对一个精心设计的提示词却能展现出令人惊叹的推理和创作能力。Prompt Engineering就是研究如何设计这些提示词的学科——它不是玄学，也不是简单的&quot;说清楚你要什么&quot;，而是一套建立在对语言模型工作原理理解之上的系统方法论。</p>\n<p>本知识库面向需要在工作中频繁使用大语言模型的开发者、产品经理和技术写作者。无论你是在构建AI应用、设计AI辅助工作流还是仅仅想让ChatGPT更好地回答你的问题，这里的内容都将帮助你从&quot;凭感觉写提示词&quot;进化到&quot;有章法地设计提示词&quot;。</p>\n<p>全书共分五个章节：</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>提示词基础</strong>从语言模型的工作原理出发，讲解Token和上下文窗口的概念、提示词的基本组成部分以及模型如何处理和理解你的输入，帮助你建立关于Prompt Engineering的正确心智模型。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>核心提示技巧</strong>介绍经过广泛验证的提示词技术，包括零样本和少样本提示、思维链推理、角色扮演和输出格式控制等核心方法，帮助你掌握日常使用中最高频也最有效的提示策略。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>系统提示词设计</strong>深入系统级提示词的架构设计，涵盖指令层级的组织方式、约束和护栏的设置方法以及动态上下文注入的技术，帮助你为AI应用设计稳定可靠的系统提示词。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>高级Prompt模式</strong>探索更复杂的提示词设计模式，包括任务分解与规划、自我反思与批评、多轮对话设计和工具调用提示，帮助你在复杂应用场景中充分发挥模型的能力。</p>\n<p>第五章<strong>评估与迭代</strong>讲解如何科学地评估和改进提示词的效果，涵盖评估方法的选择、A/B测试的设计、提示词版本管理和生产环境中的Prompt运维，帮助你建立可持续优化的提示词工程实践。</p>\n<p>建议从第一章开始建立基础认知，第二章的核心技巧适合所有用户重点掌握。如果你是AI应用开发者，第三到五章是必读内容；如果你主要是日常使用AI工具，前两章加上第四章的多轮对话部分就能覆盖大部分场景。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prompt-fundamentals","title":"Prompt 基础原理","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/prompt-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-prompt-engineering","title":"什么是 Prompt Engineering","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/prompt-fundamentals/what-is-prompt-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"how-llms-process-prompts","title":"LLM 如何处理 Prompt","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/prompt-fundamentals/how-llms-process-prompts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"token-and-context-window","title":"Token 与上下文窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/prompt-fundamentals/token-and-context-window"},{"seq":4,"slug":"prompt-anatomy","title":"Prompt 解剖学","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/prompt-fundamentals/prompt-anatomy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-techniques","title":"核心提示技巧","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/core-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"zero-shot-and-few-shot","title":"Zero-Shot 与 Few-Shot","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/core-techniques/zero-shot-and-few-shot"},{"seq":2,"slug":"chain-of-thought","title":"思维链 (Chain of Thought)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/core-techniques/chain-of-thought"},{"seq":3,"slug":"role-playing-and-persona","title":"角色扮演与人设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/core-techniques/role-playing-and-persona"},{"seq":4,"slug":"output-format-control","title":"输出格式控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/core-techniques/output-format-control"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"system-prompt-design","title":"系统提示词设计","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/system-prompt-design","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"system-prompt-architecture","title":"系统提示词架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/system-prompt-design/system-prompt-architecture"},{"seq":2,"slug":"instruction-hierarchy","title":"指令层级与优先级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/system-prompt-design/instruction-hierarchy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"constraint-and-guardrails","title":"约束与护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/system-prompt-design/constraint-and-guardrails"},{"seq":4,"slug":"dynamic-context-injection","title":"动态上下文注入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/system-prompt-design/dynamic-context-injection"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"advanced-patterns","title":"高级 Prompt 模式","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/advanced-patterns","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"decomposition-and-planning","title":"任务分解与规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/advanced-patterns/decomposition-and-planning"},{"seq":2,"slug":"self-reflection-and-critique","title":"自我反思与批判","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/advanced-patterns/self-reflection-and-critique"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-turn-conversation-design","title":"多轮对话设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/advanced-patterns/multi-turn-conversation-design"},{"seq":4,"slug":"tool-use-prompting","title":"工具调用提示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/advanced-patterns/tool-use-prompting"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"evaluation-and-iteration","title":"评估与迭代","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/evaluation-and-iteration","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prompt-evaluation-methods","title":"Prompt 评估方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/evaluation-and-iteration/prompt-evaluation-methods"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ab-testing-and-comparison","title":"A/B 测试与对比","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/evaluation-and-iteration/ab-testing-and-comparison"},{"seq":3,"slug":"prompt-versioning","title":"Prompt 版本管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/evaluation-and-iteration/prompt-versioning"},{"seq":4,"slug":"production-prompt-ops","title":"生产环境 Prompt 运维","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-engineering/evaluation-and-iteration/production-prompt-ops"}]}]}